The [Set up AI card session](#local_2c6fda28-de55-4fec-a9fa-f183faf7c9b5) has merged its change into your local `jusprin-dev`, and I checked that the commit is there. It isn't pushed yet; `origin/jusprin-dev` is still one commit behind. The commit, d93011ac7d, makes three changes to the card:
