The [PayPal session's](#local_92607d89-53ce-49de-b66c-6c7f1e5b7f3f) automated check of PayPal's window now passes on Windows, with the same six checks that pass on the Mac. That check runs against a stand-in checkout page on the test machine, not PayPal itself. Testing against real PayPal on staging waits for the Windows app build to finish.

